{"at":"2026-10-05T07:21:21.985Z","toolCall":{"args":{"Arguments":{"conclusion":"支持在清空回滚或 DOM 异常恢复时，将原输入节点准确插回原父节点及 nextSibling 位置，保障唯一输入框与 DOM 拓扑原子恢复。","content":"Node: insertBefore() method - Web APIs | MDN: The insertBefore() method of the Node interface inserts a node before a reference node as a child of a specified parent node. If referenceNode is null, newNode is inserted at the end of node's child nodes. If the given node already exists in the document, it is moved from its current position. Baseline: Widely available (since July 2015).","scope":"technical","source":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Node/insertBefore"},"ServerName":"project_architect","ToolName":"evidence_record","toolAction":"Recording Node.insertBefore evidence","toolSummary":"Record Node.insertBefore evidence"},"name":"call_mcp_tool"},"decision":"allow","stepIdx":120,"imagePath":null}
{"at":"2026-10-05T07:21:26.426Z","toolCall":{"args":{"Arguments":{"conclusion":"在严重回插失败等极端回滚异常时，采用只读 textarea（readonly 属性）呈现已捕获的用户草稿全文，允许用户点击并手动选中复制，且纯文本赋值杜绝 HTML 注入，无需剪贴板权限或外部存储。","content":"HTMLTextAreaElement: readOnly property - Web APIs | MDN: The readOnly property of the HTMLTextAreaElement interface indicates that the user cannot modify the value of the control. Unlike the disabled attribute, the readonly attribute does not prevent the user from clicking or selecting in the control. Baseline: Widely available (since July 2015).","scope":"technical","source":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLTextAreaElement/readOnly"},"ServerName":"project_architect","ToolName":"evidence_record","toolAction":"Recording HTMLTextAreaElement.readOnly evidence","toolSummary":"Record textarea readonly evidence"},"name":"call_mcp_tool"},"decision":"allow","stepIdx":122,"imagePath":null}
{"at":"2026-10-05T07:21:30.361Z","toolCall":{"args":{"Arguments":{"conclusion":"明确 compositionend 在输入法会话完成或取消时触发（如中文拼音输入），并提供 generated characters（event.data）。在清空重置时需结合节点闭包与代际隔离，防止旧会话的迟到 compositionend 污染新输入或触发伪空值校验。","content":"Element: compositionend event - Web APIs | MDN: The compositionend event is fired when a text composition system such as an input method editor completes or cancels the current composition session (e.g., after entering a Chinese character via Pinyin IME). Baseline: Widely available (since July 2015).","scope":"technical","source":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Element/compositionend_event"},"ServerName":"project_architect","ToolName":"evidence_record","toolAction":"Recording compositionend evidence","toolSummary":"Record compositionend evidence"},"name":"call_mcp_tool"},"decision":"allow","stepIdx":124,"imagePath":null}
{"at":"2026-10-05T07:21:34.730Z","toolCall":{"args":{"Arguments":{"conclusion":"证实 InputEvent.isComposing 为只读布尔属性，指示 input 事件是否发生在 compositionstart 与 compositionend 之间；在 300ms 自动展示逻辑中用于过滤拼音组合输入中的临时拼音字符，仅在非组合态或 compositionend 提交后才调度防抖展示。","content":"InputEvent: isComposing property - Web APIs | MDN: The InputEvent.isComposing read-only property returns a boolean value indicating if the event is fired after compositionstart and before compositionend. Baseline: Widely available.","scope":"technical","source":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/InputEvent/isComposing"},"ServerName":"project_architect","ToolName":"evidence_record","toolAction":"Recording InputEvent.isComposing evidence","toolSummary":"Record isComposing evidence"},"name":"call_mcp_tool"},"decision":"allow","stepIdx":126,"imagePath":null}
