T07:20:03.955Z","outcome":"not-applicable","source":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Node/insertBefore"},{"applicability":"查证 HTMLTextAreaElement.readOnly 属性规范，证实其支持在用户不可修改的同时仍可点击和选中（unlike disabled），支撑在严重回插失败等极端回滚异常时，采用只读 textarea 呈现已捕获的用户草稿全文，允许用户点击并手动选中复制，且纯文本 value 赋值杜绝 HTML 注入，无需剪贴板权限或外部存储。","content":"HTMLTextAreaElement: readOnly property - Web APIs | MDN: The readOnly property of the HTMLTextAreaElement interface indicates that the user cannot modify the value of the control. Unlike the disabled attribute, the readonly attribute does not prevent the user from clicking or selecting in the control. Baseline: Widely available (since July 2015).","hash":"5bf8e5f908da5de79a5cdbfd201716d7b658fc6cb055df51e0ef3b8d57805616","id":"evidence-8d52b774-8940-4f2b-892a-fa5b471b2b5e","kind":"official-source","location":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLTextAreaElement/readOnly","obtainedAt":"2026-10-05T07:20:18.343Z","outcome":"not-applicable","source":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLTextAreaElement/readOnly"},{"applicability":"查证 Element.compositionend 标准事件规范，证实其在输入法会话完成或取消时触发（如中文拼音输入），并提供 generated characters（event.data）。在清空重置时需结合节点闭包与代际隔离，防止旧会话的迟到 compositionend 污染新输入或触发伪空值校验。","content":"Element: compositionend event - Web APIs | MDN: The compositionend event is fired when a text composition system such as an input method editor completes or cancels the current composition session (e.g., after entering a Chinese character via Pinyin IME). Baseline: Widely available (since July 2015).","hash":"b1aa74664ab9c0fb7825c8eed5eeb6938d1bd3d089f3d90dab2799d63e883f0b","id":"evidence-4078273b-7521-4409-97fc-977c6f5cc584","kind":"official-source","location":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Element/compositionend_event","obtainedAt":"2026-10-05T07:20:38.163Z","outcome":"not-applicable","source":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Element/compositionend_event"},{"applicability":"证实 InputEvent.isCo